    "imperial_faction_victory_unit_item_name": "Imperial Supremacy",
    "imperial_faction_victory_unit_item_description": "The Emperor himself sits on his throne in the control room. All will bow before the power of this fully armed and operational battlestation.",
    "imperial_unlock_faction_victory_item_research_subject_name": "Imperial Supremacy",
    "imperial_unlock_faction_victory_item_research_subject_name_uppercase": "IMPERIAL SUPREMACY",
    "imperial_superlaser_ability_name": "Full Reactor Ignition",
    "imperial_superlaser_ability_desc": "The DS-1 Orbital Battlestation's massive antimatter annihilator reactors are momentarily overcharged to fill massive capacitors capable of holding at least a week's worth of output from a yellow dwarf star. This power is pushed through the power diversion solenoid and directed into the eight reactor lenses lining its large dish, firing a powerful beam capable of destroying the gravitational binding energy of a planet. These massive reactors also power a multitude of weapons systems and particularly resilient deflector shields. A hammer in a universe of nails.",
    "imperial_allegiance_power_surge_ability_name": "시제품 보호막 과충전 배열",
    "imperial_allegiance_power_surge_ability_description": "얼리전스는 제국이 투입할 수 있는 가장 강력한 함선이므로 반드시 보호해야 합니다. 적의 기술과 우월한 제국 설계를 사용하여 새로운 시제품 보호막 배열이 개발되었습니다. 배틀크루저에 반물질 비축량이 남아있는 동안에는 보호막이 강력하게 유지될 것입니다.",
    "imperial_venator_sphat_ability_name": "SPHA-T 터보레이저",
    "imperial_garrison_ability_name": "행성 주둔",
